Fresh entry hole
description: the entry_hole state
- >
  An empty row without a marker yet - the typed prefix decides the row's shape, exactly as a line
  of yamlover source would. A BARE scalar token committed here becomes the NODE's own scalar line
  (the omni self-value, entered as-is, no marker; at most one per block). An array element is
  spelled with its `- ` marker, a field with its key and colon. Reached after every entry-level
  commit, so typing flows row to row without reaching for the mouse
- !!<*yamlover: $defs: table>
  header:
    - Event
      width: 2
    - 'Condition / note'
      width: 4
    - 'Next state'
      width: 2
  - ['`alphanumeric`', '', '[unquoted_scalar_appending](::server:yamlover-editor:unquoted_scalar_appending)']
  - ['`dash_space`', '', '[value_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:value_hole)']
  - ['`key_colon_space`', 'the key already exists in the node', '[error_flash](::server:yamlover-editor:error_flash)']
  - ['`key_colon_space`', 'otherwise', '[value_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:value_hole)']
  - ['`key_colon_enter`', 'the key already exists in the node', '[error_flash](::server:yamlover-editor:error_flash)']
  - ['`key_colon_enter`', 'otherwise', '`entry_hole` (stays)']
  - ['`bang_bang_lt`', '', '[meta_tag_editing](::server:yamlover-editor:meta_tag_editing)']
  - ['`asterisk`', '', '[pointer_entry](::server:yamlover-editor:pointer_entry)']
  - ['`pipe`', '', '[block_scalar_editing](::server:yamlover-editor:block_scalar_editing)']
  - ['`open_brace`', '', '[flow_map_editing](::server:yamlover-editor:flow_map_editing)']
  - ['`open_bracket`', '', '[flow_seq_editing](::server:yamlover-editor:flow_seq_editing)']
  - ['`enter`', '', '[nop](::server:yamlover-editor:nop)']
  - ['`backspace`', '', '[focus_prev](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_prev)']
  - ['`tab`', 'a previous ordinal sibling exists', '`entry_hole` (stays)']
  - ['`tab`', 'otherwise', '[nop](::server:yamlover-editor:nop)']
  - ['`shift_tab`', 'the hole is below the root level', '`entry_hole` (stays)']
  - ['`shift_tab`', 'otherwise', '[nop](::server:yamlover-editor:nop)']
  - ['`up_arrow`', '', '[focus_prev](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_prev)']
  - ['`down_arrow`', '', '[focus_next](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_next)']
